bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">8ebd8be6-f565-4aac-8c13-febc32a8a72e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8ebd8be6-f565-4aac-8c13-febc32a8a72e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8ebd8be6-f565-4aac-8c13-febc32a8a72e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Knights_of_the_Shield_Hideout\" title=\"Knights of the Shield Hideout\">Knights of the Shield Hideout</a>: On a message board at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-746&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;555</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Please find within our latest intelligence on the city's lockdown and alternative smuggling routes to the <a href=\"/wiki/Upper_City\" title=\"Upper City\">Upper City</a>. Take note, and destroy after reading.\n</p><p><br>\n[The rest of the note appears to have been torn off.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063644\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1610/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29744/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6651/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930800/52428800 byte